      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've been staring at this blank page for hours and everything just feels... hollow. like there's nothing left to say because nothing actually matters. i'm trying to write something about how the only real truth is the silence at the end of everything, but it feels like i'm just chasing a ghost. i feel so incredibly empty lately, like i'm just waiting for the credits to roll.",
